# Belt-and-suspenders: no secrets.toml exists yet (checked directly against your machine), but
# this is the single most common way Streamlit projects accidentally leak API keys to a public
# repo, so it's blocked pre-emptively rather than waiting for one to show up.
**/.streamlit/secrets.toml